//www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:f500e9d656421a6207e8fa0b018cec93 .\n_:f500e9d656421a6207e8fa0b018cec93 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> \"Projection type must be a GraphQL type name (PascalCase).\" .\n_:f500e9d656421a6207e8fa0b018cec93 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> \"^[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*$\" .\n_:f500e9d656421a6207e8fa0b018cec93 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\n_:f500e9d656421a6207e8fa0b018cec93 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> \"1\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:f500e9d656421a6207e8fa0b018cec93 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://anatomy.canonical.com/projectionType> .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/ProjectionShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> \"Fragment-style graph binding: a type condition, a field path, or both — never neither.\" .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/ProjectionShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Projection Shape\" .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/ProjectionShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://anatomy.canonical.com/Projection> .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/ProjectionShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/SymbolListShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:b961e3087c8bc1dc07535703dbae9839 .\n_:b961e3087c8bc1dc07535703dbae9839 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> \"Every consumed element must be a dt: token symbol IRI with a dotted local name.\" .\n_:b961e3087c8bc1dc07535703dbae9839 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> \"^https://dt\\\\.canonical\\\\.com/[a-z]+(\\\\.[A-Za-z0-9]+)+$\" .\n_:b961e3087c8bc1dc07535703dbae9839 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI> .\n_:b961e3087c8bc1dc07535703dbae9839 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> \"1\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:d4ecb9aa6181735d0585d18fcbc3c5e7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .\n_:aa91f534bebc0f63602c2bce3a9e1cd3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:d4ecb9aa6181735d0585d18fcbc3c5e7 .\n_:d4ecb9aa6181735d0585d18fcbc3c5e7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> .\n_:aa91f534bebc0f63602c2bce3a9e1cd3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:a258399607409ad126366aa27e31941a .\n_:a258399607409ad126366aa27e31941a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#zeroOrMorePath> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> .\n_:b961e3087c8bc1dc07535703dbae9839 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> _:aa91f534bebc0f63602c2bce3a9e1cd3 .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/SymbolListShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> \"The shape of anatomy:consumes: every member of the\\n    rdf:List is an IRI in the token graph's namespace whose local name is a\\n    dotted symbol. The list is the fallback order, so its head is the primary\\n    symbol; a member that is a literal, a blank node or an IRI outside dt: is\\n    a violation. Whether a member RESOLVES — whether the token graph declares\\n    that symbol — is not asked here: a name no stratum declares is kept as\\n    consumed with a register row (AT.09), and the check belongs to the\\n    consumer holding the strata.\" .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/SymbolListShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Symbol List Shape\" .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/SymbolListShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/StyleShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"The valueKind disjunction above is generated from registry.ttl.\" .\n<https://anatomy.canonical.com/StyleShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> \"A style tuple must match its key's valueKind: a token key consumes symbols, a primitive key carries a literal and consumes none, an either key does one or the other.\" .\n_:c8fbdf4166880c89ae4801ec3ecde611 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .\n_:c8fbdf4166880c89ae4801ec3ecde611 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:ad3b3f06d0d8a02fd6e8ecd6138236d2 .\n_:ad3b3f06d0d8a02fd6e8ecd6138236d2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:cbf4ea624b7d7e725cbcbc08e4e0c862 .\n_:d1a94e51707af2f98ee589dd2b268f40 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> \"^[a-z]+(\\\\.[A-Za-z0-9]+)+$\" .\n_:cbf4ea624b7d7e725cbcbc08e4e0c862 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:d1a94e51707af2f98ee589dd2b268f40 .\n_:cbf4ea624b7d7e725cbcbc08e4e0c862 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://anatomy.canonical.com/styleValue> .\n_:ad3b3f06d0d8a02fd6e8ecd6138236d2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:e10c2ab6655a7a4cf49148ded314585c .\n_:e10c2ab6655a7a4cf49148ded314585c <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> \"0\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:e10c2ab6655a7a4cf49148ded314585c <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://anatomy.canonical.com/consumes> .\n_:ad3b3f06d0d8a02fd6e8ecd6138236d2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:a11c5f52c8dacdbcdb63f92827f9b00e .\n_:b0d521e1b7c25d9d6510695713cb440e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"typography.weight\" .\n_:b0d521e1b7c25d9d6510695713cb440e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .\n_:d4102480f10fe77692dcf1d13435de2a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"typography.size\" .\n_:d4102480f10fe77692dcf1d13435de2a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:b0d521e1b7c25d9d6510695713cb440e .\n_:a2a24aed3a7a2b9baa3f16d2b5d2da0b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"typography.lineHeight\" .\n_:a2a24aed3a7a2b9baa3f16d2b5d2da0b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:d4102480f10fe77692dcf1d13435de2a .\n_:dd1e9c9ba61741e4d102e439fdf827e1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"typography.letterSpacing\" .\n_:dd1e9c9ba61741e4d102e439fdf827e1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:a2a24aed3a7a2b9baa3f16d2b5d2da0b .\n_:db4f1251118fa71069abac7b1cf8a61c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"typography.fontFamily\" .\n_:db4f1251118fa71069abac7b1cf8a61c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:dd1e9c9ba61741e4d102e439fdf827e1 .\n_:ded427b1e268786f7a666f3362201479 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"typography.font\" .\n_:ded427b1e268786f7a666f3362201479 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:db4f1251118fa71069abac7b1cf8a61c .\n_:ed8f6944e50df4e5db33dac563e37d66 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"typography.decoration.thickness\" .\n_:ed8f6944e50df4e5db33dac563e37d66 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:ded427b1e268786f7a666f3362201479 .\n_:d5310be250695f08f25bfad81fa8018b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"typography.color\" .\n_:d5310be250695f08f25bfad81fa8018b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:ed8f6944e50df4e5db33dac563e37d66 .\n_:fc7da4cce93e1266fe7810b4f8a5d15c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"spacing.internal.top\" .\n_:fc7da4cce93e1266fe7810b4f8a5d15c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:d5310be250695f08f25bfad81fa8018b .\n_:ed4ceea022e839709e337ce8d73ff8d9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"spacing.internal.left\" .\n_:ed4ceea022e839709e337ce8d73ff8d9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:fc7da4cce93e1266fe7810b4f8a5d15c .\n_:dd156fcfa10078c57d3596ecf5157e98 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"spacing.internal.inline.start\" .\n_:dd156fcfa10078c57d3596ecf5157e98 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:ed4ceea022e839709e337ce8d73ff8d9 .\n_:e9eae8e6f191c728d31c6930003cf5a4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"spacing.internal.inline.end\" .\n_:e9eae8e6f191c728d31c6930003cf5a4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#re